=== A. M is a market-center official close, not the consolidated last ===
  regular last 100.03; M official-close print 100.00
  consolidated last stays 100.03; volume stays 1,000,000
  participant last updates to 100.00
  do not use an M print as the consolidated official close, or fold it into the regular-hours last sale
=== B. Q updates the consolidated open, not the consolidated last or volume ===
  Q official-open print 50.00 -> consolidated open 50.00; consolidated last 50.10; volume 0
  participant last stays 50.10; participant high/low includes 50.00-50.10
=== C. T is not last-sale eligible; it does update volume, including ETH ===
